   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development objectives are to contribute to the ensuring of IDP rights and to strengthen civic society values among Georgian youth. Among project objectives are: to increase understanding and competence on a local/regional level on IDPs rights; Achieve adequate changes in behaviour from officials and IDPs; To facilitate equal and full human development among female and male students.</narrative>
